.TH REM-USER-ACCOUNT 7 "September 2026" "REM system documentation" "Miscellaneous Information"
.SH NAME
rem-user-account \- REM account setup status and integration requirements
.SH DESCRIPTION
The inspected REM development rootfs has no /etc/passwd, /etc/group, or
/etc/shadow and no configured login, getty, useradd, passwd, su, or sudo
command. Its init script launches a root console shell. This system therefore
has no qualified normal-user account workflow.
.PP
Do not create a passwd entry and assume that it enables authentication or a
login session. Account database population, shell assignment to
/usr/bin/yash, home ownership, password management, supplementary groups and
controlling-terminal session setup must be implemented and tested together.
.SH SEE ALSO
REM_USER_MANAGEMENT.md, REM_SYSTEM_ADMIN.md
